001786             4486   ;EXPR - VARIABLE-TYPE EXPRESSION EVALUATION
001786             4487   ; Expression type is returned in A'F':
001786             4488   ; Numeric - A' bit 7=0, F' sign bit cleared.
001786             4489   ; String - A' bit 7=1, F' sign bit set.
001786             4490   ;Floating-point or integer result returned in HLH'L'C
001786             4491   ; Integer result denoted by C=0 and HLH'L' non-zero.
001786             4492   ;String result returned in string accumulator, DE set.
001786             4493   ;
001786             4494   ;Hierarchy is: (1) Variables, functions,
001786             4495   ; constants, bracketed expressions.
001786             4496   ; (2) ^
001786             4497   ; (3) * / MOD DIV
001786             4498   ; (4) + -
001786             4499   ; (5) = <> <= >= > <
001786             4500   ; (6) AND
001786             4501   ; (7) EOR OR
